    <string name="about_attribution_title">Data attribution</string>
    <string name="about_attribution_body">Camera locations come from Taiwanese government open data (data.gov.tw), released under the Open Government Data License v1.0 (政府資料開放授權條款—第1版): national datasets 7320 測速執法設置點 and 13940 國道公路固定式測速照相地點, plus municipal datasets from Taipei (130111, 135957), Taoyuan (25935), Taichung (170673), Kaohsiung (176549, 176555, 176558, 176560, 176561, 177827), Changhua (172905), Yunlin (178085, 178086), Keelung (178159) and Penghu (156415, 172940).</string>
